# Production client environment. Vite loads this automatically for `npm run build`.
#
# The GA4 measurement ID is not a secret: it is visible in the page source of every
# site that runs Google Analytics. It is committed here rather than left in an
# untracked .env so that any machine which builds the site keeps tracking switched
# on. See docs/seo/fixes-applied.md (C1).
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-MDVF551H1C
